   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
    "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
    "ver": "0.46.0"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Finish a H3 video (Echo / Motion output)\nRuns on a **finished** video, on its own: restart ComfyUI first (or Manager / Unload models) so the big video models leave RAM.\n\n1. Copy the video from `output/video/` into `ComfyUI/input` and pick it in the first box.\n2. **HD:** Real-ESRGAN 2x, then down to 1080 x 1890. It is always on.\n3. **Skin detail** (green slider): puts the pores and skin texture back that the upscale smooths away. 0 = off.\n4. **Grain** (green slider): light phone-sensor grain on top, 0 = off. The sharpen is a fixed light 0.03.\n5. **Smooth motion** (green switch): RIFE doubles 24 to 48 fps. It is memory heavy, so turn it off if the pod runs out of RAM or for clips over about 10 s.\n6. The original audio is kept. Output: `video/H3_Model2_Finish_00001.mp4`.\n\nTo compare: set skin detail to 0 and grain to 0 and run again with the same video."
   ],
   "title": "READ ME · Model 2 · finish a H3 video",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
